; ==========================================================================
; STELLAR RACER  -  keep the car on a winding road   (loads at $4000)
; ==========================================================================
; Load, cold-boot, press a key. The road streams down the screen; <- and -> steer
; the car on lines 23-24, up / down arrows change the speed (1-9), ESC quits.
; Touch either edge of the road and you crash; any key then starts a new game.
; Speed and distance show at the bottom left ("SPD 5  00123").
;
; VT100: ESC M (reverse index) at the top of the screen moves the whole road down;
; cursor addressing draws the rest. No scrolling region: Craig's terminal ignores
; it (Scroll-Check: only test A, a plain ESC M, works) - v1 needed one and its road
; never moved down on the Elf2K.
;
; VERIFICATION (Firmware-Math/racer_verify.py, V0061.33): an autopilot driving from the screen: 300 frames without a crash, every road line (1-24) exactly two edges 17 apart and moving at most one column a line, the car whole on lines 23-24, the distance counting; up/down arrows take SPD 5->9 (capped) and down to 1 (capped); hands off the wheel it crashes at exactly the first frame the road touches the car's padding; after a crash an arrow key starts a new game and a lone ESC quits (screen cleared, cursor shown); never sends a scrolling region; a rerun without reloading plays cleanly and ESC at the title quits. ~17,500 1802 instructions a frame at speed 9, ~51,000 at speed 1.
; This version not yet run on hardware.
;
; 279 STELLAR commands.
;
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; DISASSEMBLY  -  commented out; the loader skips it
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------

; D 4000 CD             START
; D 4001 11 0F 00 0A    LOADXI R15 000A
; D 4005 11 0B 00 00    LOADXI R11 0000                    RB = 0: the index for patching strings
; D 4009 11 0E 07 85    LOADXI R14 0785
; D 400D C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; SEED:
; D 400F C3             RAND                               Spin the generator until a key comes: every road differs
; D 4010 CC             SERST
; D 4011 A1 00 0F       IFFALSEI SEED
; D 4014 BD 02 D9       CALL ANYKEY                        Take it (an ESC on its own quits)
; NEW:
; D 4017 11 0E 07 76    LOADXI R14 0776
; D 401B C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       Clear, hide the cursor
; D 401D 11 02 00 20    LOADXI R2 0020
; D 4021 11 03 00 01    LOADXI R3 0001                     straight
; D 4025 11 04 00 17    LOADXI R4 0017                     a straight start
; D 4029 11 05 00 27    LOADXI R5 0027                     the car in the middle
; D 402D 11 06 00 05    LOADXI R6 0005
; D 4031 11 07 00 01    LOADXI R7 0001
; D 4035 11 08 00 00    LOADXI R8 0000
; D 4039 11 01 00 00    LOADXI R1 0000
; D 403D 11 0D 00 01    LOADXI R13 0001
; D 4041 11 09 0F 00    LOADXI R9 0F00
; D 4045 11 0A 0F 3F    LOADXI R10 0F3F
; D 4049 FB 9A 20       FILLMEMXY R9..RA 20                The ring: the road was straight
; D 404C 11 0C 00 18    LOADXI R12 0018
; PRE:
; D 4050 BD 01 AB       CALL ROADROW                       Draw a straight road down the screen
; D 4053 43 0C          DECX R12
; D 4055 8C 0C          TESTXZ R12
; D 4057 A1 00 50       IFFALSEI PRE
; D 405A BD 02 05       CALL STATUS
; FRAME:
; D 405D BD 02 6C       CALL KEYS
; D 4060 43 04          DECX R4
; D 4062 8C 04          TESTXZ R4
; D 4064 A1 00 6A       IFFALSEI SAME                      This stretch goes on
; D 4067 BD 01 E8       CALL NEWSEG
; SAME:
; D 406A 50 23 02       ADDXYZ R2 + R3 -> R2
; D 406D 53 02 00 01    SUBXI R2 0001                      L += direction - 1
; D 4071 86 02 00 0E    TESTXI R2 000E
; D 4075 A1 00 80       IFFALSEI C1
; D 4078 11 02 00 0F    LOADXI R2 000F
; D 407C 11 03 00 02    LOADXI R3 0002                     hit the left side: turn right
; C1:
; D 4080 86 02 00 3F    TESTXI R2 003F
; D 4084 A1 00 8F       IFFALSEI C2
; D 4087 11 02 00 3E    LOADXI R2 003E
; D 408B 11 03 00 00    LOADXI R3 0000                     hit the right side: turn left
; C2:
; D 408F BD 01 AB       CALL ROADROW
; D 4092 50 57 05       ADDXYZ R5 + R7 -> R5
; D 4095 53 05 00 01    SUBXI R5 0001                      x += steer - 1
; D 4099 11 07 00 01    LOADXI R7 0001                     steer used up
; D 409D 86 05 00 01    TESTXI R5 0001
; D 40A1 A1 00 A8       IFFALSEI C3
; D 40A4 11 05 00 02    LOADXI R5 0002
; C3:
; D 40A8 86 05 00 4D    TESTXI R5 004D
; D 40AC A1 00 B3       IFFALSEI C4
; D 40AF 11 05 00 4C    LOADXI R5 004C                     never near column 80: no wrap
; C4:
; D 40B3 23 00 59       COPYXY R5 -> R9
; D 40B6 53 09 00 01    SUBXI R9 0001                      the padding column
; D 40BA 4D 9F          DIVXY R9 / R15
; D 40BC 25             COPYMAA
; D 40BD 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 40C0 2F 0B 07 1D    WRITEIDX R11 071D
; D 40C4 27             COPYREMA
; D 40C5 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 40C8 2F 0B 07 1E    WRITEIDX R11 071E
; D 40CC 4D 9F          DIVXY R9 / R15
; D 40CE 25             COPYMAA
; D 40CF 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 40D2 2F 0B 07 3E    WRITEIDX R11 073E
; D 40D6 27             COPYREMA
; D 40D7 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 40DA 2F 0B 07 3F    WRITEIDX R11 073F
; D 40DE 11 0E 07 18    LOADXI R14 0718
; D 40E2 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14                       The car, with a space either side
; D 40E4 2E 08 0F 0A    READIDX R8 0F0A                    the road's left edge on line 23
; D 40E8 21 09          COPYAX Acc -> R9
; D 40EA 23 00 9A       COPYXY R9 -> R10
; D 40ED 52 09 00 01    ADDXI R9 0001
; D 40F1 88 95          TESTGXY R9 >= R5
; D 40F3 A0 01 4A       IFTRUEI CRASH                      car against the left edge
; D 40F6 52 0A 00 0E    ADDXI R10 000E
; D 40FA 88 5A          TESTGXY R5 >= R10
; D 40FC A0 01 4A       IFTRUEI CRASH                      car against the right edge
; D 40FF 2E 08 0F 09    READIDX R8 0F09                    the road's left edge on line 24
; D 4103 21 09          COPYAX Acc -> R9
; D 4105 23 00 9A       COPYXY R9 -> R10
; D 4108 52 09 00 01    ADDXI R9 0001
; D 410C 88 95          TESTGXY R9 >= R5
; D 410E A0 01 4A       IFTRUEI CRASH                      car against the left edge
; D 4111 52 0A 00 0E    ADDXI R10 000E
; D 4115 88 5A          TESTGXY R5 >= R10
; D 4117 A0 01 4A       IFTRUEI CRASH                      car against the right edge
; D 411A 42 08          INCX R8
; D 411C 86 08 00 20    TESTXI R8 0020
; D 4120 A1 01 27       IFFALSEI I1
; D 4123 11 08 00 00    LOADXI R8 0000
; I1:
; D 4127 42 01          INCX R1                            distance
; D 4129 43 0D          DECX R13
; D 412B 8C 0D          TESTXZ R13
; D 412D A1 01 37       IFFALSEI NOST
; D 4130 BD 02 05       CALL STATUS
; D 4133 11 0D 00 08    LOADXI R13 0008
; NOST:
; D 4137 11 09 00 09    LOADXI R9 0009
; D 413B 51 96 09       SUBXYZ R9 - R6 -> R9               9 - speed delay steps
; DL:
; D 413E 8C 09          TESTXZ R9
; D 4140 A0 00 5D       IFTRUEI FRAME
; D 4143 C0 0C          DLYI 0C                            one speed step
; D 4145 43 09          DECX R9
; D 4147 B0 01 3E       GAL DL
; CRASH:
; D 414A 23 00 59       COPYXY R5 -> R9
; D 414D 53 09 00 01    SUBXI R9 0001
; D 4151 4D 9F          DIVXY R9 / R15
; D 4153 25             COPYMAA
; D 4154 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 4157 2F 0B 07 4C    WRITEIDX R11 074C
; D 415B 27             COPYREMA
; D 415C 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 415F 2F 0B 07 4D    WRITEIDX R11 074D
; D 4163 4D 9F          DIVXY R9 / R15
; D 4165 25             COPYMAA
; D 4166 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 4169 2F 0B 07 6D    WRITEIDX R11 076D
; D 416D 27             COPYREMA
; D 416E 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 4171 2F 0B 07 6E    WRITEIDX R11 076E
; D 4175 BD 02 05       CALL STATUS
; D 4178 11 0E 07 47    LOADXI R14 0747
; D 417C C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 417E 11 0E 08 2E    LOADXI R14 082E
; D 4182 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 4184 11 0C 00 28    LOADXI R12 0028                    Swallow keys still coming for ~1 s: no accidental restart
; FL:
; D 4188 CC             SERST
; D 4189 A1 01 8D       IFFALSEI FL2
; D 418C CB             SERIN
; FL2:
; D 418D C0 0C          DLYI 0C
; D 418F 43 0C          DECX R12
; D 4191 8C 0C          TESTXZ R12
; D 4193 A1 01 88       IFFALSEI FL
; AGAIN:
; D 4196 C3             RAND
; D 4197 CC             SERST
; D 4198 A1 01 96       IFFALSEI AGAIN
; D 419B BD 02 D9       CALL ANYKEY                        ESC on its own quits
; D 419E B0 00 17       GAL NEW                            Anything else (arrows too): drive again
; QUIT:
; D 41A1 11 0E 08 7A    LOADXI R14 087A
; D 41A5 C1 0E          PRINTSTR R14
; D 41A7 00             HALT
; D 41A8 F0 00 00       BREAK
; ROADROW:
; D 41AB 22 02          COPYXA R2 -> Acc
; D 41AD 2F 08 0F 00    WRITEIDX R8 0F00                   this line into the ring
; D 41B1 2F 08 0F 20    WRITEIDX R8 0F20                   ... twice
; D 41B5 4D 2F          DIVXY R2 / R15                     left edge column
; D 41B7 25             COPYMAA
; D 41B8 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 41BB 2F 0B 07 0A    WRITEIDX R11 070A
; D 41BF 27             COPYREMA
; D 41C0 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 41C3 2F 0B 07 0B    WRITEIDX R11 070B
; D 41C7 23 00 29       COPYXY R2 -> R9
; D 41CA 52 09 00 11    ADDXI R9 0011
; D 41CE 4D 9F          DIVXY R9 / R15                     right edge column
; D 41D0 25             COPYMAA
; D 41D1 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
; D 41D4 2F 0B 07 13    WRITEIDX R11 0713
; D 41D8 27             COPYREMA
; D 41D9 4E 00 30       ADDAI 0030
